#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STM32F7 Series Chip Variant Selection
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file defines chip variants for STM32F7 series.
# TODO: Add specific chip variants (F722, F723, F730, F732, F733, F745, F746, F750, F756, F765, F767, F769, F777, F778, F779)
